0..67 Comment "//! `cancel-base` gives the task protocol for cancellation sources."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..148 Comment "//! A task sends its note on `Join`. A cancellation clause resumes its scope"
149..229 Comment "//! once. The clause can abandon that scope. The clause cancels an abandoned end"
230..247 Comment "//! for its peer."
248..251 Comment "//!"
252..330 Comment "//! Each cancellation source imports `Cancel`. The checker uses `Join` to type"
331..348 Comment "//! a parent end."
349..352 Comment "//!"
353..418 Comment "//! - cites: [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]"
419..422 Comment "//!"
423..589 Comment "//! [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3290341 \"Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova, Exceptional Asynchronous Session Types\""
591..667 Comment "/// A task: the protocol its end carries back to the parent, and the path it"
668..678 Comment "/// reads."
